{"2875410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pinnacle Point", "steam_appid": 2875410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY &amp; WORLD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first expedition thought they were changing the world. Pinnacle Point would be the breakthrough, the place where the known rules of physics no longer seemed to apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island gave them just enough to believe that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aron saw the cracks early. He felt it in his gut that something was off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His brother didn't agree, he always thought he knew better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So Aron left, leaving him behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the dreams won't stop. Neither will the voice that sounds too much like his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island didn't forget, and Aron can't either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.poster.avif?t=1779438873\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.webm?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.mp4?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay with Modern elements:</strong> Navigate the island with a blend of exploration, puzzle-solving, and strategic combat. Resources are scarce, and encounters with the grotesque inhabitants are a tense, life-or-death struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> A cinematic blend of dynamic and fixed camera angles enhances the suspenseful, immersive experience. Dense fog, flickering lights, and unsettling sounds keep you constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Discover the island’s dark secrets through cryptic notes, fragmented memories, and environmental cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Horror:</strong> The line between reality and nightmare blurs as you delve deeper into the true nature of the island, your brother’s fate and the fate of those who sought to control it. Atmospheric sound design and meticulously crafted environments build a world steeped in horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.poster.avif?t=1779438873\" width=610 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.webm?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.mp4?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being worked on. Gameplay, screenshots or trailers might be subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY &amp; WORLD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first expedition thought they were changing the world. Pinnacle Point would be the breakthrough, the place where the known rules of physics no longer seemed to apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island gave them just enough to believe that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aron saw the cracks early. He felt it in his gut that something was off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His brother didn't agree, he always thought he knew better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So Aron left, leaving him behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the dreams won't stop. Neither will the voice that sounds too much like his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island didn't forget, and Aron can't either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.poster.avif?t=1779438873\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.webm?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.mp4?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay with Modern elements:</strong> Navigate the island with a blend of exploration, puzzle-solving, and strategic combat. Resources are scarce, and encounters with the grotesque inhabitants are a tense, life-or-death struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> A cinematic blend of dynamic and fixed camera angles enhances the suspenseful, immersive experience. Dense fog, flickering lights, and unsettling sounds keep you constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Discover the island’s dark secrets through cryptic notes, fragmented memories, and environmental cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Horror:</strong> The line between reality and nightmare blurs as you delve deeper into the true nature of the island, your brother’s fate and the fate of those who sought to control it. Atmospheric sound design and meticulously crafted environments build a world steeped in horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.poster.avif?t=1779438873\" width=610 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.webm?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.mp4?t=1779438873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being worked on. Gameplay, screenshots or trailers might be subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A dark, 90s-inspired psychological/cosmic horror set on a remote island. You play as Aron, returning years after an ill-fated expedition, haunted over abandoning his brother. Uncover the secrets of the island, confront the horrors awakened, and face those who seek to control its power.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410